 in some...unrealistic conditions in this simulation. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But the result...was pretty much the same as the last 69 attempts."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Helian","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"NPC-Persica","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Helian","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then let's leave it for now. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The expenses for this kind of simulation are rather hefty."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Helian","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"NPC-Persica","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Persica","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's alright. Certain characteristics can already be surmised from the results. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"At this rate...I'll be able to find the best solution to repairing M4A1's neural cloud."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Helian","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"NPC-Persica","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Helian","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I may not be a professional, but... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Is the repair to M4A1's neural cloud...really this complicated?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Helian","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"NPC-Persica","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Persica","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(Sighs) Do please think bigger, Miss Source-of-Capital. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"These simulations aren't just for repairing M4A1. I'm also studying the differences between the AI tech of IOP and Sangvis Ferri. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We could very well be looking...right at a new technological breakthrough..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Helian","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"NPC-Persica","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Helian","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh? Have you had any significant discovery?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Helian","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"NPC-Persica","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Persica","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I've been looking into the Sangvis command network systematically this time. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Unlike our mesh-shaped dummy network, Sangvis command authorization is spread down in a tree-shaped structure. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's not as flexible as ours, but the combat efficiency is much higher."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Helian","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"NPC-Persica","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Helian","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I've heard about that, but our T-Dolls can't adopt a network like that, can they?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Helian","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"NPC-Persica","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Persica","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Again, think bigger, Miss Academicism."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Our T-Dolls can't, but we can use it for something else."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Helian","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"NPC-Persica","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Helian","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Uh...so what's the big idea?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Helian","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags"